  <p>These third parties have access to your Personal Information only to perform tasks assigned to them. They are obligated not to disclose or use the information for any other purpose.</p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>We value your trust in providing us your Personal Information. We strive to use commercially acceptable means of protecting it. But remember no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.</p>

